{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_019970","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"任务中饮料够喝吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯，没问题。还有马黛茶。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"马黛茶啊……那个也不错，不过你不会也想喝点汽水吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是想喝，但任务中哪能挑三拣四。这里又不是时代广场，想买什么都能买。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"别那么沮丧，Snake。研发班开发出了一种新的碳酸饮料。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":74,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"名字就叫『Mountain Dew』！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY; PROPER_NAME_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"山间露水，Mountain Dew。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY; WORDPLAY_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"对。以大自然为意象，是一款清爽的柑橘风味饮料。碳酸又不会太强，就算累了也能大口大口地喝。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"NO_RELIABLE_AUX_REFERENCE; JPN_ONLY"}]}